  "description": "Heightened levels of speed, comfort, and versatility make the Roadmachine 01 TWO an all-road bike engineered to excel wherever you ride. At its core is our ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame – the highest-grade layup we offer – providing uncompromising responsiveness, compliance and an ultra-low weight.\nWider tire clearance and tuned comfort turn broken roads and light gravel into smooth, efficient riding surfaces. This carbon road bike model features a SRAM Force AXS groupset with integrated power meter for reliable, rapid shifting and instant performance feedback, while the ICS2 stem and carbon bar combination provides adaptable fit, precise steering, and fully integrated cable management. Then there’s a rear light and integrated storage, too.\nThe ultimate all-road ride is rounded off with our CE 40 SL Carbon tubeless-ready wheels that give you extreme reliability, ready for endless tire setups, and performance across all surfaces.\nBecause at the end of the day, it’s the Roadmachine 01 and it’s here for it all.",
